  <section class="mp-section" id="canada-pricing"><div class="mp-wrap mp-split"><div><p class="mp-kicker">05 / Commercial terms you can compare</p><h2>A Canadian campaign.<br>A clearly stated currency.</h2><p class="mp-price">From US$4,000<span> / month</span></p><p>The public starting rate is in US dollars. It applies to a campaign-ready managed programme with a defined offer and market, usable accounts or contacts, CRM and calendar access, and a team ready for meetings.</p><p>Fresh research, licensed data, extra territories and expanded capacity are scoped separately. Most programmes begin with an initial three-month engagement. Confirm currency, applicable taxes and payment terms in your written proposal.</p><p><a href="/pricing/">Review full pricing</a>, including the distinction between a booking and a held, qualified meeting.</p></div><aside class="mp-tool"><h3>Build a business case<br>using your own numbers.</h3><p>Enter your expected investment and customer economics. Use the same currency across the calculation; the calculator labels its amounts in US dollars.</p><a class="mp-button" href="/b2b-lead-generation-roi-calculator/">Calculate Your Campaign ROI ↗</a><p class="mp-small">Track actual attendance and sales acceptance with the <a href="/b2b-meeting-quality-check/">Meeting Quality Check</a>.</p></aside></div></section>

